<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for your booking to travel with your dog, [<strong>insert name of dog</strong>] in the aircraft cabin with Qantas. We note that your itinerary includes travel to/ from Norfolk Island.<br />
<br />
<strong>For travel to Norfolk Island from Australia</strong><br />
<br />
In order to travel with your Service Dog to Norfolk Island from Australia, you must check and adhere to the requirements regarding animal importation as stipulated by the Department of Agriculture Water and Environment and the Norfolk Island Regional Council.<br />
<br />
In addition, to facilitate travel in the aircraft cabin with your dog, Qantas is required to check:
<ul>
	<li>Your veterinary health certificate issued in Australia; and</li>
	<li>Written confirmation from the Norfolk Island Department of Agriculture office that your dog has been approved for travel to Norfolk Island on the date of your booking.</li>
</ul>
Please provide us with a copy of the above documentation at least 24 hours prior to departure.<br />
<br />
<strong>For travel from Norfolk Island to Australia</strong><br />
<br />
In order to travel with your Service Dog from Norfolk Island to Australia, you must check and adhere to the requirements regarding animal importation as stipulated by the Department of Agriculture Water and Environment.<br />
<br />
In addition, to facilitate travel in the aircraft cabin with your dog, Qantas is required to check:
<ul>
	<li>Your veterinary health certificate issued in Norfolk Island; and</li>
	<li>Written confirmation from the relevant regional office in the state or territory of arrival that your dog has been approved for travel to mainland Australia from Norfolk on the date of your booking.</li>
</ul>
Please provide us with a copy of the above documentation at least 24 hours prior to departure.</body>
</html>